+        订单号：<strong>${escapeHtml(order.id)}</strong> | 原价合计：¥${order.subtotal.toFixed(2)} | 实付：¥${order.payable.toFixed(2)} | 剩余可退：¥${round2(order.payable - order.refundedAmount).toFixed(2)}
